  "category": "tsp_memetic_edge_recombination",
  "description": [
    "**TSP permutation memetic search with edge and mapping crossover.** Use a symmetric complete matrix. Build a small permutation population from nearest-neighbor, farthest insertion and random starts.\n\n",
    "Alternate edge recombination and partially mapped crossover. Pass each child to 2-opt, 3-opt, then 2-opt before comparing it to the worst member. Selection thus receives an improved permutation rather than the raw genetic child.\n\n",
    "This local-search and direct permutation design differs from fitness-only random-key decoding. The chosen alternation and replacement policy are project adaptations. The code keeps strict improvement of replacement scores."
